WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,350
Those twenty-spice wine

2
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:09,830
I pay double

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:16,100
Sorry for selling them all to me

4
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,340
This store has its own rules

5
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,900
Since the wine has been sold to Mr. Pei,

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:23,580
Once you receive the money, there is no reason to resell it to others. This is a small business. Luck is very important. I hate that the money is too little.

7
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,580
You want Master to open your mouth, right?

8
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,900
Okay, just tell me the number. I'll give you this opportunity. Even if you offer 20,000 yuan, it's not enough.

9
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,630
Is that two hundred thousand enough? I'm sorry, Boss Xue.

10
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,150
I think I've said it clearly enough

11
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:36,150
If you don't have anything else to do, I'm still busy with business so I won't give it away.

12
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:40,670
I really thought I wouldn’t be able to do anything without those two bottles of wine of yours. Since I like to stick to rules so much, I’ll stick with you, a loser, for the rest of my life.
